  "repo_truth": "Six complete-subject reviews exposed repeated validator hardening edges and demonstrated that the draft calibration still allowed open-ended severity inflation. The parent stopped the seventh open-ended review before completion. It then added the missing terminal rule: the default automatic budget is one discovery review/burst, one consolidated remediation, and one different-fresh delta-focused closure review; P2 requires a demonstrated effect on the selected integrated outcome; budget exhaustion preserves a real blocker but returns it for explicit adjudication instead of auto-looping. All six prior P2 rounds are remediated, including the sixth review's NUL, literal-dot, and Inventory-section findings. The full validator and both self-tests pass. This is the single bounded closure review. The exact complete current subject is the twenty-path manifest above at baseline HEAD 2f9b3cc17bc194461f88b17177e8f2e31ce92626.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Verify all twenty frozen hashes and aggregate subject identity.",
    "Verify the sixth review's three known P2 remediations: NUL is controlled-rejected by schema and semantics, literal dot is semantic-rejected, and only the unique canonical Inventory section can register rows.",
    "Verify the new review-budget and outcome-linked priority language is coherent across 00, 04, 05, 06, 07, 08, and 09 and preserves genuine P1/P2 blocking quality.",
    "Run the existing handoff validator, both self-tests, changed-document link/format checks, and git diff whitespace checks.",
    "Return a bounded closure verdict. Report a P1/P2 only with evidence of failure in the selected integrated calibration outcome; disposition defense-in-depth, malformed-input hardening, speculative robustness, and unrelated discovery as P3/P4 inventory candidates."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No new open-ended adversarial discovery campaign and no attempt to enumerate every possible malformed path, Markdown shape, or redundant-defense disagreement.",
    "No edits, staging, commits, pushes, handoffs, ledger writes, dispatch creation, or delegation.",
    "No Rust, product runtime, test, dependency, Cargo, package, version, HCM-2.4 planning, or unrelated control-pack changes.",
    "No automatic recommendation for another review/remediation loop."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Replay the complete subject fingerprint before review.",
    "Reproduce the three sixth-review failures and confirm each now rejects in the integrated gate with controlled behavior.",
    "Check the review-budget, P2/P3 boundary, CLEAN meaning, advisory inventory, and bounded-stop rules for direct contradictions.",
    "Confirm all prior blocking findings are remediated and no supported/repository-reachable state defeats the selected calibration outcome.",
    "Run the bounded validation wall named in allowed_scope.",
    "Return findings first with stable comparison keys. CLEAN means no unresolved demonstrated P1/P2 under the calibrated integrated-outcome rubric; list any P3/P4 advisory with an inventory disposition."
  ],
